{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"harsh-church","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The scenario evidence looks good overall. I'm particularly pleased with the S-candidate-ranking and S-restart-recovery steps, which ran successfully and produced strong results. However, I'm still evaluating the S-competing-tools leg. While two tools expressed the same need and produced comparable rankings, only one was adequate, meaning the \"produce comparable results\" bar isn't fully met. I'm scoring this moderately, around 0.6-0.7, but I'll need to consider the S-list-project's successful competition between two adequate wiki tools as well."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:36:35.363271600+00:00"}}}}
