{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"harsh-church","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI've compared the existing features against the GreyAvatar manifest, finding parity in about 27 out of 33 areas. Meridian has an imitation mark that GreyAvatar lacks, and Meridian's voice and STT capabilities are thinner. While both have functional parity for persona art, Meridian lacks a general image pipeline. Meridian's UI is browser-based compared to GreyAvatar's native shell, and several features like LAN mirror, android satellite, companion, fleet, exchange media, storefronts, memetic exchange, contacts, and location are absent or only partially implemented in Meridian. However, Meridian's calendar/temporal features are deeper, and its ethics floor is stronger."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:37:31.266952700+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"harsh-church","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nMeridian .003 is nearly complete, covering most core features but with partial depth in voices, surfaces, proactive attention, and STT. Key absences include fleet deployment, LAN mirroring, satellite features, storefronts, and full connector breadth. Cycle-2 achieved 0.55, with new additions in .003 closing gaps in surfaces and connectors, bringing existing features to an estimated 0.6, though major absent blocks still dominate."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:37:32.917971400+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"harsh-church","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm assessing feature completeness against prompt requirements. Most sections are covered, but communication surfaces are only partially implemented, lacking QR/AVQR packages and robust spoken input. Exchange and storefront capabilities are also incomplete, with package import below threshold and no storefront or AVQR. The fleet and exchange media features are entirely absent."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:37:35.096276100+00:00"}}}}
